# Line endings. Git for Windows converts text files; these rules keep that safe:
* text=auto
# Windows batch files need CRLF, or "goto" can break. Release zips (git archive) follow this too.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# Files whose exact bytes matter: never convert.
tools/bip39_english.txt -text
*.srt -text
*.png binary
*.mkv binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
